    ("4.4", "Lab report references correct batch/sample ID", "Flag", "CLIENT ID '9-2026-w3-AECN', SAMPLED 18-Sep-2026 17:00 (Ops Summary D17 composited 2026-09-18), RECEIVED 22-Sep-2026, report 23-Sep-2026: the identity ties. The LOCATION field prints 'FORT LUPTON, CO' on the AECN page, while the AECN composite is drawn at Basco, Louisiana; W2's certificate printed the same location. [log:lab_results.client_id, lab_results.sampled, lab_results.received, lab_results.location_on_certificate, lab_results.prior_week_location, ops_notes.summary_aecn]", "VR Sec 5.1"),
